OL,3,AIs Vine back? Short-form video-sharing
OL,4,Aapp Divine opens to public
OL,5,
OL,6,FDivine's founder, former Twitter
OL,7,Femployee Evan Henshaw-Plath, told the
OL,8,FBBC he wanted to create the app because
OL,9,Fhe felt social media needed "a reset".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/18
